<section class="grid min-h-[65vh] items-center gap-12 md:grid-cols-[1.2fr_.8fr]"><div><p class="mb-4 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[.2em] text-ice">Full-stack + DevOps</p><h1 class="font-display text-5xl font-semibold leading-tight text-white sm:text-7xl">Software that ships, scales, and stays reliable.</h1><p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate-300">I’m Obrien Takunda Gwanyanya. I design and develop practical web products, then strengthen delivery with Docker, CI/CD pipelines, and production-minded workflows.</p><div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3"><a class="rounded-lg bg-ice px-5 py-3 font-semibold text-ink hover:bg-white" href="/work/">See projects</a><a class="rounded-lg border border-slate-600 px-5 py-3 font-semibold text-white hover:border-ice" href="/contact/">Start a conversation</a></div></div><img src="/images/hero.webp" alt="Portrait of Obrien Takunda Gwanyanya" class="mx-auto w-full max-w-sm rounded-3xl border border-slate-700 shadow-2xl" /></section>
</BaseLayout>
